            "n": "8",
            "t": "verse",
            "text": "yo mā'gne bhāginam̐ santama-thā-bhāgañ cikīrṣati । \nabhāgama-gne taṅ kuru māma-gne bhāginaṅ kuru ॥8॥",
            "translation": {
              "en": "O Agni, whoever wishes to deprive me, the fortunate one, make him dispossessed, o Agni! Make me fortunate, o Agni!"
            },
